<p>If music be the food of love, play on”</p>
<cite>Shakespeare</cite></blockquote>

<p><a href="https://www.tetonvalleycmf.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Teton Valley Chamber Music Festival</a> exists to share our love of classical chamber music with the community through various concerts and to create performance opportunities for young musicians.&nbsp;This past year we sponsored our first Teton Valley Children’s Choir and are looking forward to putting on our second festival this summer from July 22-26 at Teton High School. Come join us for a beautiful week of music-making in the mountains! Visit our website today for this summer’s festival concert schedule and discover more about our music programs!&nbsp;</p>
